    + "\n"
    + "honor Show<BigInt> =\n"
    + "    (** The decimal form of `value`, with no `n` suffix — `1n` shows as `1`. *)\n"
    + "    show(value) = nativeShow(value)\n"
    + "\n"
    + "honor Pow<BigInt> =\n"
    + "    (** `left` raised to the power `right`, exactly. Raises\n"
    + "        `NegativeExponentError` when `right` is negative: a negative power of an\n"
